  "text": "Skip to content\nLocal preview\nDraft content · 9 October 2026\nartifactory.\nProjects\nInvestors\nOur approach\nAbout\nEN\n/\nPL\nLet’s talk\nHome\nPartnerships\n\nPARTNERSHIPS\n\nBring a question. Build understanding.\n\nExplore possible collaboration around sensing, physical validation and photonic engineering tools.\n\n01 /\nARTISENSE\nMeasurement & reference methods\n\nHow can an optical hypothesis be tested physically?\n\nRelevant expertise\n\nExpertise in optical measurement, calibration and experiment design.\n\nA starting point\n\nDiscuss the hypothesis, the required reference and evaluation criteria.\n\nDiscuss a partnership\n02 /\nARTISENSE / AIFIELD\nFabrication & testing\n\nWhat would it take to move a design into an experiment?\n\nRelevant expertise\n\nExperience with photonic fabrication, integration and characterization.\n\nA starting point\n\nDiscuss feasibility, design constraints and the measurements needed.\n\nDiscuss a partnership\n03 /\nAIFIELD\nEngineering-tool evaluation\n\nWhich task would meaningfully test the design workflow?\n\nRelevant expertise\n\nExperience in photonic design and simulation comparison.\n\nA starting point\n\nDefine a task, its inputs and the outputs for a shared review.\n\nDiscuss a partnership\ni\n\nThese are proposed discussion areas, not confirmed open programmes or existing partner relationships. Active needs, project owners and the scope of any collaboration must be agreed before work begins. No partner logos or customer commitments are implied.\n\nTHE NEXT CONVERSATION\n\nLet’s explore what\ncomes next.\n\nInvest in the company. Explore the science. Bring a question worth working on.\n\nDiscuss an investment\nExplore partnerships\nartifactory.\n\nEngineering light. Creating possibility.\n\nSensing technology and tools for designing photonic systems.\nProjects\nAll projects\nArtiSense\nAIFIELD\nCompany\nHome\nInvestors\nOur approach\nAbout\nPartnerships\nGet in touch\ninfo@artifactory.tech\nContact\nPrivacy\nArtifactory · 2026\nLocal review edition. Content and Polish translations await owner review.\nBack to top ↑",
